@startuml
!include common-style.puml

title State Machine — Visit Status

skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  BorderColor #334155
  FontColor #111827
  FontSize 14
  StartColor #0F766E
  EndColor #B91C1C
  ArrowColor #455A64
}

[*] --> WAITING : Receptionist creates visit\n(POST /api/v1/visits)

WAITING --> IN_EXAM : Doctor opens examination\n(POST /visits/{id}/open-examination)
WAITING --> CANCELLED : Administrative cancel

IN_EXAM --> DONE : Doctor completes examination\n(POST /examinations/{id}/complete)
IN_EXAM --> CANCELLED : Administrative cancel

DONE --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]

note right of WAITING
queueNumber auto-assigned.
Status enforced at VisitsService.
Duplicate same-day visit rejected (BR-05).
end note

note right of IN_EXAM
Visit is synchronized with Examination:
- WAITING -> IN_EXAM when exam opens
- IN_EXAM -> DONE when exam completes
end note

note right of DONE
DONE status enables:
- Invoice creation (BillingService)
- Medical history view
end note

@enduml
